        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Rudd\n- Organizations: AC/DC\n- Products: AC/DC's third LP\n- Places: Australia, Europe\n- Roles: bass guitar\n\nFacts:\n- In 1976, AC/DC's third LP was released in Australia and in Europe.\n- The individual who played bass guitar on AC/DC's third LP later left AC/DC.\n- When that bass guitarist left AC/DC, Phil Rudd became the only Australian-born member of AC/DC.",
